WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Have you ever felt absolutely certain you saw something?

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In a memory experiment, people confidently recognized words never shown.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Hypnosis did not repair that error. Separate observation from inference.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Choose one task. Notice distractions. Write down what happened.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
A twelve-minute routine does not prove commercial audio improves focus.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Read the evidence before deciding. Final Vestige Studios.
